{"4894150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "City Crime Simulator", "steam_appid": 4894150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City Crime Simulator is an open world action game where you take on the role of a fearless fighter determined to eliminate criminal gangs and reclaim the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a city filled with dangerous gangsters, engage in intense gunfights, use grenades and close combat attacks, and complete action-packed objectives across multiple locations. Travel freely through streets, residential areas, and waterfront regions while hunting down enemies that threaten the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game phone system to access special cheat codes dial code to instantly call vehicles whenever you need transportation. Drive cars, motorcycles, buses, and trucks to move around the city faster and reach new destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Feature: -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Packed Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/d1e47c53c3479e6ce20cd0add618be49.poster.avif?t=1784186739\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/d1e47c53c3479e6ce20cd0add618be49.webm?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/d1e47c53c3479e6ce20cd0add618be49.mp4?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face hostile criminals throughout the city and engage in fast paced combat whenever danger appears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle Driving</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/296bbf44f118490863c0d5fedda90635.poster.avif?t=1784186739\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/296bbf44f118490863c0d5fedda90635.webm?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/296bbf44f118490863c0d5fedda90635.mp4?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of different vehicles and travel across the city with complete freedom. Reach objectives faster and explore new areas with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coastal Road Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/6de2e6a788d32da48173fab94587fdeb.poster.avif?t=1784186739\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/6de2e6a788d32da48173fab94587fdeb.webm?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/6de2e6a788d32da48173fab94587fdeb.mp4?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive along scenic coastal roads and discover remote parts of the map beyond the main city areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/cbe69743cc96873cf9a0c7da3d512aa0.poster.avif?t=1784186739\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/cbe69743cc96873cf9a0c7da3d512aa0.webm?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/cbe69743cc96873cf9a0c7da3d512aa0.mp4?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different parts of the city freely and discover streets, neighborhoods, hidden locations, and new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swimming &amp; Waterfront Areas</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/961b13c1d77cc60493ec59c5fee36096.poster.avif?t=1784186739\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/961b13c1d77cc60493ec59c5fee36096.webm?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/961b13c1d77cc60493ec59c5fee36096.mp4?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the water, swim freely along the coastline, and explore areas beyond the city streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third Person Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/4c13ce39713a17095c3d7729fc586b12.poster.avif?t=1784186739\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/4c13ce39713a17095c3d7729fc586b12.webm?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/4c13ce39713a17095c3d7729fc586b12.mp4?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the city from an immersive third person perspective while exploring, fighting, and completing objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emergency Escape</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/d86118c689edfc48239a0bff93835b22.poster.avif?t=1784186739\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/d86118c689edfc48239a0bff93835b22.webm?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/d86118c689edfc48239a0bff93835b22.mp4?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your vehicle falls into deep water, exit immediately and swim back to land before continuing your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armed Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/7889ca487d89bc07f9153185c121db20.poster.avif?t=1784186739\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/7889ca487d89bc07f9153185c121db20.webm?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/7889ca487d89bc07f9153185c121db20.mp4?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of weapons to take down gang members and dominate dangerous areas across the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/d10787eeac20fdc2d55a37cc55586a8e.poster.avif?t=1784186739\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/d10787eeac20fdc2d55a37cc55586a8e.webm?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894150/extras/d10787eeac20fdc2d55a37cc55586a8e.mp4?t=1784186739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront criminals directly on the streets using your combat skills and weapons to eliminate threats throughout the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer exploring, combat, driving, or causing chaos, City Crime Simulator gives you the freedom to play your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City Crime Simulator is an open world action game where you take on the role of a fearless fighter determined to eliminate criminal gangs and reclaim the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a city filled with dangerous gangsters, engage in intense gunfights, use grenades and close combat attacks, and complete action-packed objectives across multiple locations. Travel freely through streets, residential areas, and waterfront regions while hunting down enemies that threaten the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game phone system to access special chea